  /* Schematic blocks:
     1. ESP32-S3-MINI-1-N8R2 (U1) — main SoC
     2. SX1262 868 MHz (U2) — SPI
     3. ICM-42688-P 6-axis IMU (U3) — SPI (2000 Hz seizure sampling)
     4. MAX30102 PPG/SpO2 (U4) — I2C
     5. AD5940 EDA impedance (U5) — I2C (separate bus)
     6. DRV2605L haptic driver (U6) — I2C
     7. ST7789V LCD (U7) — SPI
     8. BQ25895 PMIC (U8) — I2C + USB-C charging
     9. ERM haptic motor (MOT1)
     10. 500 mAh LiPo (BAT1)
     11. USB-C 2.0 charging port (J1)
     12. Buttons: Home (SW1), SOS (SW2)
     Pin assignments: see README.md
  */
)